%% Zettings plugin lifecycle state machine.
%% Render: `mmdc -i plugin-lifecycle.mmd -o plugin-lifecycle.svg`

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered: scan /usr/lib/zyntrix/zettings/modules/<br/>+ ~/.local/share/zyntrix/zettings/modules/

    Discovered --> SignatureVerified: ring::Ed25519 verify
    Discovered --> Rejected: signature missing AND<br/>no user override in zettings.toml

    SignatureVerified --> CapabilityChecked: parse module.toml<br/>and Capability set
    SignatureVerified --> Rejected: manifest invalid<br/>(missing polkit_actions, bad route, etc.)

    CapabilityChecked --> Mounted: capability subset of shell ACL
    CapabilityChecked --> Rejected: capability superseded by shell policy

    Mounted --> Active: frontend navigates to its route
    Active --> Mounted: route left (keep warm in cache)
    Mounted --> Suspended: low-memory pressure<br/>(systemd OOMD signal)
    Suspended --> Mounted: user revisits OR<br/>background indexer completes

    Mounted --> Unloaded: explicit unload<br/>(user disable, module update)
    Unloaded --> [*]

    Rejected --> [*]
    Rejected: log reason to journald<br/>+ surface banner in shell
